---
import '../../../../public/styles/global.css'
---

<div class="bg-[#191A16] py-16 px-4">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
    <div class="text-center mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-white text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold leading-tight mb-4">
        USE CASES FOR EVERY<br/>
        LEVEL AND <span class="text-lime-400">PLAYING STYLE</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="text-gray-300 text-lg max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        From newcomers to seasoned pros, Tennibot's pickleball machine adapts to every style.
      </p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
      
      <div class="bg-[#262424] rounded-lg p-8 space-y-6">
        <div class="inline-flex">
       
           <a
    href="#book-demo"
class="bg-[#2b2e17] border-2 border-[#C0F20C] text-white px-5 py-2 rounded-full font-bold text-base uppercase tracking-wider hover:bg-lime-400 hover:text-black transition-all duration-300"
  >
Beginner
  </a>
        </div>
        
        <h3 class="text-white text-xl font-bold leading-tight">
          BUILD CONSISTENCY<br/>
          AND CONFIDENCE
        </h3>
        
        <p class="text-gray-300 text-base leading-relaxed">
          Start with slow, predictable shots and feeds to 
          develop proper form and build muscle 
          memory. The Tennibot Partner helps 
          newcomers master the fundamentals.
        </p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="bg-[#262424] rounded-lg p-8 space-y-6">
        <div class="inline-flex">
              <a
    href="#book-demo"
class="bg-[#2b2e17] border-2 border-[#C0F20C] text-white px-5 py-2 rounded-full font-bold text-base uppercase tracking-wider hover:bg-lime-400 hover:text-black transition-all duration-300"
  >
            Intermediate
        </a>
        </div>
        
        <h3 class="text-white text-xl font-bold leading-tight">
          IMPROVE FOOTWORK<br/>
          AND STRATEGY
        </h3>
        
        <p class="text-gray-300 text-base leading-relaxed">
          Challenge yourself with varied shots and 
          court coverage drills. Perfect for players 
          looking to elevate their tactical game.
        </p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="bg-[#262424] rounded-lg p-8 space-y-6">
        <div class="inline-flex">
              <a
    href="#book-demo"
class="bg-[#2b2e17] border-2 border-[#C0F20C] text-white px-5 py-2 rounded-full font-bold text-base uppercase tracking-wider hover:bg-lime-400 hover:text-black transition-all duration-300"
  >
            Competitive
        </a>
        </div>
        
        <h3 class="text-white text-xl font-bold leading-tight">
          CREATE MATCH-LIKE DRILLS,<br/>
          SIMULATE REAL RALLIES
        </h3>
        
        <p class="text-gray-300 text-base leading-relaxed">
          Design complex training scenarios that 
          mirror tournament play. Coaches can 
          create specific drills for team training.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>